&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Red Cell Partners is an incubation firm building and investing in rapidly scalable technology-led companies that are bringing revolutionary advancements to market in three distinct practice areas: healthcare, cyber, and national security. United by a shared sense of duty and deep belief in the power of innovation, Red Cell is developing powerful tools and solutions to address our Nation’s most pressing problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-ccp-border-bottom=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-bottom=&quot;0px&quot; data-ccp-border-between=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-between=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About Trase:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-border-bottom=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-bottom=&quot;0px&quot; data-ccp-border-between=&quot;0px none #000000&quot; data-ccp-padding-between=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572087&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572088&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572089&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789814&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;Co-founded in 2023 by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redcellpartners.com/member/joe-laws/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Joe Laws&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redcellpartners.com/member/grant-verstandig/&quot;&gt;Grant Verstandig&lt;/a&gt;, Trase Systems is AI, Uncomplicated. Trase empowers enterprise leaders to harness the full potential of AI without the associated complexity and risks. We are an end-to-end solution for deploying, managing, and optimizing AI in the enterprise. Our platform specializes in bridging the “last mile” of AI adoption, unlocking AI&#39;s full potential while driving efficiency and significant cost savings.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Trase is at the forefront of&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;AI Agent&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;innovation, topping the Hugging Face GAIA Leaderboard for Generalized AI Assistants, ahead of industry giants such as Google, Meta, Microsoft, and OpenAI. We are leveraging our cutting-edge technologies to develop mission-critical agentic applications in complex industries such as Healthcare, Oil &amp;amp; Gas, and National Security.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572087&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572088&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335572089&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789814&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;nil&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trase is an agentic AI platform in production at Duke Health, where our agents save over 5,490 hours of clinical labor annually in a single department. We’ve raised $10.5M from Red Cell Partners. Now we’re building the go-to-market engine to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a GTM Engineer—not a traditional SDR. One person who builds and operates the entire top-of-funnel system using AI tools, data enrichment, and automated workflows. You’ll be measured on the quality of the pipeline you create and the meetings you book. &amp;nbsp;The way you will get there is by engineering systems, not grinding through call lists.&amp;nbsp; You will also actively listen to the market and synthesize and feed that information back into Trase’s positioning and ICP definitions.&amp;nbsp; The agent stack will handle execution, and you will own the intelligence layer on top of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate workflows, with tools like Clay, that research, enrich, and score 121+ target hospital accounts automatically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure intent signals and respond to buying triggers—new CMIO hires, AI strategy announcements, RFPs—within 4 hours with AI-personalized outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize outreach sequences; A/B test messaging; track conversion rates by tier and channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather market intelligence and feed that back into Trase’s internal systems to refine our positioning and ICP definitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the pre-conference outreach machine for high-value conferences — scheduling 15–25 meetings before each event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate AI-powered meeting prep briefs and post-call follow-ups so senior sellers stay focused on closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Salesforce as the source of truth and report weekly on what’s working, what’s not, and what’s changing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document everything you build so this function can scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 2–4 years in B2B sales, sales ops, rev ops, or growth—and you were the person who built the systems, not just used them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are hands-on with Clay, Apollo, Salesforce, or similar GTM tooling. You’ve configured workflows, not just run someone else’s sequences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a systems thinker. You see a manual process and immediately design how to automate it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong writer. Your outreach reads like a human did two hours of research—because an AI did, and you shaped the message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working independently at an early-stage company. You won’t be closely managed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Even Better If:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have healthcare or health-tech experience—you know what a CMIO is and how health system procurement works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have technical depth beyond no-code: SQL, Python, or API experience for custom data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve built a GTM system from scratch, not just operated one that was already running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Not What We’re Looking For:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-volume dialers, tool administrators who don’t think about outcomes, or anyone who needs a playbook handed to them. You’re building the playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Trase:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployed product with real clinical outcomes, not a pitch deck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every health system in the country is figuring out AI—you’ll be in those conversations from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True ownership: you’re building the territory, the tooling, and the outbound playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native environment—you’ll use AI tools every day, not just talk about them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Red Cell Partners–backed, leadership team that has operated at scale (President: former VP AI/ML at AWS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Base salary of&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;$130,000-$150,000 plus bonus. This represents the typical salary range for this position based on experience, skills, and other factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Red Cell Partners Benefits:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;For full-time roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
