&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in selling influencer marketing and online digital advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record of achieving and exceeding sales targets and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English with strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, well-organized, and highly responsible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic and thrives under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Where Are Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
